WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.640
Hi, I'm Dash. I help school support staff with state test prep.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:13.848
We build practice routines and calm test-day habits, so students feel ready without the stress.

00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:20.168
For example, ask me: how do I help students get ready for the state test?
